      en: ["The mountain range spans approximately 105 kilometers.", "The highest peak is Barnacken at 446 meters.", "Site of the Battle of the Teutoburg Forest in 9 AD.", "The Hermannsdenkmal was inaugurated in 1875.", "The Externsteine are a prominent sandstone formation.", "The 'Hermannsweg' ridge trail is 156 kilometers long."],
